    "note": "DELE A1 awards 25 points per skill and requires at least 30/50 in each paired group: reading plus writing, and listening plus speaking. Sixty is therefore the smallest possible passing total, but 60/100 alone is not sufficient. Instituto Cervantes does not publish four independent skill thresholds; the project assessment contract must add them rather than misattribute them to DELE."
